# Enforce LF line endings for all text files on checkout, regardless of the
# developer's local core.autocrlf setting. The repo's Prettier/ESLint config
# assumes LF (`endOfLine: lf`), and Windows runners check out CRLF by default
# — without this the lint gate produces 5,949 `Delete ␍` errors there.
#
# Binary formats (images, archives, etc.) are LEFT-ALONE by this line:
# `text=auto` only converts files Git classifies as text.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Explicitly binary formats — belt-and-braces so future *.ico/*.pngs in
# resources/ never get byte-rewritten even if a text sniff misfires.
*.icns binary
*.ico binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.woff2 binary
*.dmg binary
